 "remarks": "Enjoy the best of Stamford living in this spacious, sun-filled fifth-floor one-bed condo! Offering an oversized bedroom, generous living and dining area, and an open kitchen with breakfast bar, granite countertops, tile backsplash, and stainless-steel appliances. Luxury vinyl flooring runs throughout, complemented by an updated bathroom and the convenience of an in-unit washer/dryer. Bedroom features 2 large closets, while separate laundry room provides additional storage. One of the buildings standout amenities is the spectacular rooftop deck, perfect for morning coffee, evening dinners, or simply relaxing while taking in the beautiful view of Long Island Sound and Downtown Stamford. Enjoy an unbeatable location just steps from downtown's incredible restaurants, coffee shops, bars, shopping, and Target, with easy access to Metro North Train station. Beautifully renovated Mill River Park is practically in your backyard, offering wonderful green space, walking paths, and tons of community events all year round. The well-maintained, professionally managed building features reasonable HOA fee's, an on-site superintendent, one-car garage parking and additional resident and visitor parking. A wonderful opportunity to enjoy comfort, convenience, and the best of downtown Stamford Living",
